<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Triarc downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Triarc downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co downgraded Triarc Cos Inc to market perform from outperform, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Triarc lost 1/4 to 18-1/4.</p>
